<title>MEXICO: Elektra 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Elektra 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Shr		   5.08			   3.22</p>
<p>	Oper Income     669.7 million		839.6 million</p>
<p>	Net		 610.0 million		385.4 million</p>
<p>	Revs		4.376 bln		3.636 bln</p>
<p>	Integ fin cost  147.5 million		424.9 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>Full company name is Grupo Elektra SA.</p>
